#: data/maps/AquaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "AquaHideout_1F_Text_OurBossIsSnatchingSomething"
msgid ""
"What? What? What do you want with \n"
"TEAM AQUA?\p"
"Our BOSS isn't here! He's gone off to\n"
"snatch something important!\p"
"… …\n"
"Where did he go?\p"
"Wahaha! Do you really think I'd tell\n"
"you something that crucial?$"
msgstr ""
"什么？什么？你找海洋队\n"
"有什么事？\p"
"老大不在这里！\n"
"他去抢夺某样重要的东西了！\p"
"…… ……\n"
"他去哪里了？\p"
"哇哈哈！这么重要的事情，\n"
"你以为我会告诉你吗？$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "AquaHideout_1F_Text_WhereMightMagmaHideoutBe"
msgid ""
"What? What?\n"
"Are you a TEAM MAGMA grunt?\p"
"I hear that TEAM MAGMA is trying to\n"
"awaken an awesome POKéMON at their\l"
"HIDEOUT.\p"
"But where might their HIDEOUT be?$"
msgstr ""
"什么？什么？\n"
"你是熔岩队的手下吗？\p"
"听说熔岩队正打算在他们的\n"
"基地里唤醒一只厉害的宝可梦。\p"
"可是他们的基地到底在哪里呢？$"

