#: data/maps/AquaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:91
msgctxt "AquaHideout_1F_Text_TeamMagmaAtMtChimney"
msgid ""
"What? What?\n"
"Are you a TEAM MAGMA grunt?\p"
"I hear that TEAM MAGMA is after\n"
"an awesome POKéMON at MT. CHIMNEY.\p"
"But what is that POKéMON like?$"
msgstr ""
"什么？什么？\n"
"你是熔岩队的手下吗？\p"
